  "notes": [
    "One proxy-manager transaction switched both the IndexPool implementation (many-to-one, shared by DEFI5 and CC10) and the controller proxy to the exploited code; the attacker's own earlier orderCategoryTokensByMarketCap and reindexPool calls are permissionless attack setup, not resets.",
    "The campaign is the attacker's CC10 leg plus every successful joinswapExternAmountIn with the still-uninitialized SUSHI into DEFI5 or CC10 (attacker bot and MEV copycats) through block 13600000; joins with other tokens after the drain are not counted.",
    "Victims are the DEFI5, CC10 and FFF pools and the DEFI5, CC10 and FFF WETH pairs the copycats sold freshly minted index tokens into; their WETH is counted gross, the worthless index tokens they received are not subtracted."
